<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Opus in talks, advises caution in dealings.</title>
<headline>Opus in talks, advises caution in dealings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opus Investments Ltd on Thursday said discussions were still in progress which, if successfully concluded, could have an impact on the price at which Opus shares trade on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Opus advised shareholders to continue exercising caution when dealing in their shares.</p>
<p>An earlier cautionary announcement was made on February 24.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
